{"questions":[{"id":"Q045-V2","typeId":"代入求值","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S05:p1"],"variantOf":"Q045","variantIndex":2,"prompt":"資料表中，輸入 t＝4 時依規則輸出 −5t+10；另一欄輸出為 -40。求另一欄的輸入 t。","answer":"10","explanation":"−5t+10＝-40，所以 t＝10。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"-5*x+10=-40","root":"10","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c4","options":[{"text":"6","misconception":"移項常數時將減法誤作加法。","id":"c1"},{"text":"-10","misconception":"除以負係數時漏掉負負得正。","id":"c2"},{"text":"4","misconception":"直接抄另一欄的輸入，未解指定輸出那一欄。","id":"c3"},{"text":"10","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q045-V3","typeId":"代入求值","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S05:p1"],"variantOf":"Q045","variantIndex":3,"prompt":"資料表中，輸入 t＝5 時依規則輸出 −6t+11；另一欄輸出為 -55。求另一欄的輸入 t。","answer":"11","explanation":"−6t+11＝-55，所以 t＝11。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"-6*x+11=-55","root":"11","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c1","options":[{"text":"11","id":"c1"},{"text":"22/3","misconception":"移項常數時將減法誤作加法。","id":"c2"},{"text":"-11","misconception":"除以負係數時漏掉負負得正。","id":"c3"},{"text":"5","misconception":"直接抄另一欄的輸入，未解指定輸出那一欄。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q045-V4","typeId":"代入求值","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S05:p1"],"variantOf":"Q045","variantIndex":4,"prompt":"資料表中，輸入 t＝6 時依規則輸出 −7t+12；另一欄輸出為 -72。求另一欄的輸入 t。","answer":"12","explanation":"−7t+12＝-72，所以 t＝12。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"-7*x+12=-72","root":"12","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"text":"60/7","misconception":"移項常數時將減法誤作加法。","id":"c1"},{"text":"12","id":"c2"},{"text":"-12","misconception":"除以負係數時漏掉負負得正。","id":"c3"},{"text":"6","misconception":"直接抄另一欄的輸入，未解指定輸出那一欄。","id":"c4"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q045-V5","typeId":"代入求值","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S05:p1"],"variantOf"